# Everything is LF, including on Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ...except these two. The bundle in module/ carries a v2 tree signature that
# covers a hash of every file in it, so ANY line-ending translation invalidates
# it — a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would silently fail the
# verification in TESTING.md §1. These two ship with CRLF; marking them binary
# makes Git round-trip them byte for byte on every platform.
module/module.json -text
module/module.sig  -text
